---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="wrap">
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="brand">
      <p class="big">Land<span>Control</span></p>
      <p class="strap">Development Intelligence for the New Land Market</p>
      <p class="desc">Independent coverage of the contractual control regime for registered land in England and Wales, and the intelligence layer on the HM Land Registry dataset from April 2028.</p>
      <p class="reg">Regulations: SI 2026/615 · In force 6 April 2027 · Dataset from April 2028</p>
    </div>
    <nav class="cols" aria-label="Footer">
      <div><p class="k">Guide</p><ul><li><a href="/contractual-control-agreements/">Contractual control agreements</a></li><li><a href="/#scope">Scope and exemptions</a></li><li><a href="/#dataset">The 2028 dataset</a></li><li><a href="/new-era/">The new era</a></li></ul></div>
      <div><p class="k">Tools</p><ul><li><a href="/deadline-calculator/">Deadline calculator</a></li><li><a href="/agreement-checker/">Agreement checker</a></li><li><a href="/readiness-checklist/">Readiness checklist</a></li><li><a href="/tracker/">Implementation tracker</a></li></ul></div>
      <div><p class="k">Professionals</p><ul><li><a href="/professionals/housebuilders/">Housebuilders and promoters</a></li><li><a href="/professionals/landowners/">Landowners</a></li><li><a href="/professionals/conveyancers/">Conveyancers</a></li><li><a href="/professionals/lenders/">Lenders and analysts</a></li></ul></div>
      <div><p class="k">Company</p><ul><li><a href="/#products">Product and pricing</a></li><li><a href="/press/">Press Centre</a></li><li><a href="/#briefing">Contractual Control Alert</a></li><li><a href="mailto:contact@landcontrol.co.uk">contact@landcontrol.co.uk</a></li></ul></div>
    </nav>
    <div class="sources">
      <p class="k">Primary sources</p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2026/615" rel="noopener">The Provision of Information (Contractual Control) (Registered Land) Regulations 2026</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.legislation.gov.uk/ukpga/2023/55/section/221/2023-12-26" rel="noopener">Levelling-up and Regeneration Act 2023, Part 11</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/contractual-control-agreements/contractual-control-agreements" rel="noopener">MHCLG guidance: Contractual control agreements</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.gov.uk/guidance/hm-land-registry-new-reporting-rules-for-contractual-control-rights" rel="noopener">HM Land Registry: New reporting rules for contractual control rights</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="legal">
      <p class="disc"><strong>LandControl is an independent information and technology service and is not affiliated with HM Land Registry, the Ministry of Housing, Communities and Local Government or any part of the UK Government.</strong> Content is for general information only and does not constitute legal advice. Always confirm the position with a regulated conveyancer or solicitor.</p>
      <div class="row">
        <span>© {year} LandControl. All rights reserved.</span>
        <span>Contains public sector information licensed under the <a href="https://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/3/" rel="noopener">Open Government Licence v3.0</a>.</span>
        <span>Data sources: HM Land Registry · MHCLG · Companies House · planning.data.gov.uk</span>
        <span class="links"><a href="/press/">Press</a><a href="/tracker/">Tracker</a><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a><a href="/terms/">Terms</a><a href="/sitemap-index.xml">Sitemap</a></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
<style>
footer{border-top:4px solid var(--ink);background:var(--panel);padding-block:clamp(3rem,6vw,5rem) 2rem}
footer .grid{row-gap:2.5rem}
footer .brand{grid-column:1/span 4;display:grid;gap:.8rem;align-content:start}
footer .big{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,4.5vw,3.6rem);line-height:.9}
footer .strap{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--red)}
footer .desc{font-size:.95rem;color:var(--ink-2);max-width:34ch}
footer .reg{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.72rem;color:var(--ink-2);border-top:1px solid var(--rule);padding-top:.8rem;margin-top:.4rem}
footer .cols{grid-column:5/-1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1.5rem}
footer .k{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.66rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink);font-weight:500;margin-bottom:.8rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink)}
footer ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:.5rem}
footer a{color:var(--ink-2);text-decoration:none;font-size:.92rem;transition:color .2s}
footer a:hover{color:var(--red)}
footer .sources{grid-column:1/-1;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);padding-top:1.5rem}
footer .sources ul{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.4rem 2rem}
footer .sources a{font-size:.85rem;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:var(--rule);text-underline-offset:3px}
footer .legal{grid-column:1/-1;border-top:1px solid var(--ink);padding-top:1.5rem;display:grid;gap:1rem}
footer .disc{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--ink-2);max-width:90ch}
footer .disc strong{color:var(--ink)}
footer .row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.6rem 2rem;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--ink-2);align-items:center}
footer .row a{font-size:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:var(--rule);text-underline-offset:3px}
footer .row .links{display:flex;gap:1.2rem;margin-left:auto}
footer .row .links a{text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);font-weight:500}
footer .row .links a:hover{color:var(--red)}
@media(max-width:1000px){footer .brand,footer .cols{grid-column:1/-1}footer .cols{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
@media(max-width:600px){footer .cols{grid-template-columns:1fr}footer .sources ul{grid-template-columns:1fr}footer .row .links{margin-left:0}}
</style>
